#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/hosting_cost_html/index.html.heex:163
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only operators see this. Copy the total of a month from the invoice in Fly's dashboard; an empty sum removes the invoice of that month."
