msgid "The estimate counts the app's machines by the second, the database's plan and its data, the stored files, dedicated IPv4 addresses and the data sent out. Taxes, credits and support plans are not in it."
msgstr "Procena broji mašine aplikacije po sekundi, paket baze i njene podatke, sačuvane fajlove, namenske IPv4 adrese i poslate podatke. Porezi, krediti i planovi podrške nisu u njoj."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/hosting_cost_html/index.html.heex:73
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The first estimate is on its way: Potok writes one every quarter of an hour."
msgstr "Prva procena stiže uskoro: Potok je upisuje na svakih petnaest minuta."

